==Description==
'''Solar Shard''' was a form of non-spendable event currency that could have been earned during the [[Solar Eclipse Event]] on any map, regular or event map. 

It was used to complete Ranks on the [[Solar Eclipse Event#Solar Eclipse Season Pass|Solar Eclipse Season Pass]]. Every time a rank was earned, the amount of '''Solar Shards''' obtained were reset.

It took the appearance of a red moon.

